id: "zw_ota"
label: Z-Wave OTA
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  The Z-Wave OTA SLC component, which is a crucial component for embedded devices, can be used by applications that  support OTA (Over The Air Firmware Update). This component defines custom bootloader  storage size in flash for Z-Wave applications.
  NOTE: Bootloader size are differenet in Release and Debug mode.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license
provides:
- name: "zw_ota"
requires:
- name: flash_storage
config_file:
- path: sample_apps/config/zw_ota/sl_storage_config.h
  condition: [device_series_2]
  override:
    component: flash_storage
    file_id: storage_config
    vendor: silabs
root_path: zwave
